{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-11-12","kind":"proposition","title":"从平面上一点向平面作垂线","englishTitle":"To set up a straight line at right angles to a given plane from a given point in it.","book":11,"number":12,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.12","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.12/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":12,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-11-12@raw-f4e761626c0b4ea5","contentId":"euclid-11-12","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f4e761626c0b4ea552cd9f94ab10fedc03b03b88db792f6c5fd1aa429c5d0efe","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-11-12.statement","euclid-11-12.construction.1","euclid-11-12.construction.2","euclid-11-12.proof.1","euclid-11-12.proof.2","euclid-11-12.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-11-12.statement","contentId":"euclid-11-12","revisionId":"euclid-11-12@raw-f4e761626c0b4ea5","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"49441fd38844c899a0c5316a23dc66dbb3cf80cde816cef7a91a11f6da9dd675","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"To set up a straight line at right angles to a given plane from a given point in it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从直角到平面 设置一条直线"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-12.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-11-12","revisionId":"euclid-11-12@raw-f4e761626c0b4ea5","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c41e335cf919c4caf0281fb0dc2570ff82c9a5570a4fbf247dc78df04bcf21b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let the plane of reference be the given plane, and A the point in it; thus it is required to set up from the point A a straight line at right angles to the plane of reference."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"将平面项的参考线改为给定的平面,A项的参考线;因此,需要从A点至直角点的参考线设置一条直线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-12.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-11-12","revisionId":"euclid-11-12@raw-f4e761626c0b4ea5","order":2,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"912c36bb2d01a708154bcaade87197df74a334f4f4b329559b62ab145a5ed58a","citations":["euclid-11-11","euclid-1-31"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let any elevated point B be conceived, from B let BC be drawn perpendicular to the plane of reference, [[XI. 11](/principles/euclid-11-11)] and through the point A let AD be drawn parallel to BC. [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"任何B点的上升点,从B点到BC点,划为平面点,通过A点,划为AD点,划为BC点。 [[XI. 11](/principles/euclid-11-11)] [[I. 31](/principles/euclid-1-31)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-12.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-11-12","revisionId":"euclid-11-12@raw-f4e761626c0b4ea5","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a72f97e842f1d2487ddfdb058a80ee00f71f508aea04b746b1f0379400068822","citations":["euclid-11-8"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Then, since AD, CB are two parallel straight lines, while one of them, BC, is at right angles to the plane of reference, therefore the remaining one, AD, is also at right angles to the plane of reference. [[XI. 8](/principles/euclid-11-8)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其后,CB线是两条平行直线,其中一条线是BC,直角是参考线,其余一条是AD,也是参考线平面。 [[XI. 8](/principles/euclid-11-8)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-12.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-11-12","revisionId":"euclid-11-12@raw-f4e761626c0b4ea5","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2a7fa58924eb5c463e519a50abd21684317d176a23b08e932eab28d7a49e9f28","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore AD has been set up at right angles to the given plane from the point A in it."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,从A点起,AD点至平面点,已经设立。"}]},{"id":"euclid-11-12.source","contentId":"euclid-11-12","revisionId":"euclid-11-12@raw-f4e761626c0b4ea5","order":5,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"419945dc996d595324b85f587e41636e211e50ee1e7ca63eb879837e7da1615c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.12/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.12\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-11-12:euclid-11-11:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-11-12","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-11-12.construction.2"],"targetContentId":"euclid-11-11","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.12","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:11.prop.12/","sourceLabel":"XI. 11"}},{"id":"edge:euclid-11-12:euclid-1-31:explicit","sourceContent